    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <!-- TASK 3: fetch_video_library -->
    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <mxCell id="t3" value="[TASK 3] fetch_video_library&#xa;───────────────────────&#xa;INPUT (XCom): library_start_epoch, library_end_epoch&#xa;CONFIG: PAGINATION_CONFIG, REGIONAL_HEADERS&#xa;&#xa;PROSES (EchotikAPIClient):&#xa;  1. Build headers (Bearer token + regional + UA rotation)&#xa;  2. Loop page 1–14 (per_page=30) via _paginate_fetch()&#xa;     GET /api/v1/data/videos&#xa;       ?page={n}&amp;per_page=30&amp;start_time={epoch}&amp;end_time={epoch}&#xa;       &amp;sort=desc&amp;order=views_count&#xa;  3. Throttle 3–10s antar page, stop jika response &lt; per_page&#xa;  4. Retry logic: max 3x, backoff 10s×attempt&#xa;  5. Handle 429 → wait Retry-After, 401/403 → raise&#xa;  6. Inter-API delay: 30–60s setelah selesai&#xa;&#xa;JIKA skip: return {status: skipped}&#xa;&#xa;OUTPUT:&#xa;  • raw-data/json/video_library_{date}_to_{date}.json&#xa;  • XCom: {records_count, filepath, status}&#xa;&#xa;MONITORING: Discord → Category Summary" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="490" y="880" width="420" height="300" as="geometry" />
