    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <!-- TASK 6: parser_and_validate -->
    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <mxCell id="t6" value="[TASK 6] parser_and_validate&#xa;───────────────────────&#xa;INPUT (XCom): filepath dari task 3, 4, 5&#xa;&#xa;PROSES:&#xa;  1. Baca masing-masing raw JSON dari storage&#xa;  2. Video Library → parse_video_library_record()&#xa;     • parse_count(), parse_percentage(), parse_duration()&#xa;     • parse_datetime(), extract_hashtags/mentions/emoji&#xa;     • Hitung duration_bucket, viral_score, engagement_tier&#xa;  3. Hashtag → parse_hashtag_record()&#xa;     • Hitung avg_views_per_video, competition_level&#xa;  4. Video Selling → parse_video_selling_record()&#xa;     • parse_money_usd(), parse_money_local()&#xa;     • Hitung revenue_tier, products JSON&#xa;  5. validate_video_record() / validate_hashtag_record()&#xa;     • Cek required fields, nilai non-negatif&#xa;     • Set is_valid flag &amp; validation_errors list&#xa;  6. deduplicate_records() → tandai duplikat, set is_valid=False&#xa;  7. get_validation_summary() → total/valid/invalid/error_breakdown&#xa;  8. export_to_excel() → multi-sheet XLSX&#xa;     Sheet: video_library, hashtags, video_selling, validation_report&#xa;&#xa;OUTPUT:&#xa;  • raw-data/Excel/echotik_data_{run_date}.xlsx&#xa;  • XCom: {excel_path, total_records, valid_records, invalid_records}&#xa;&#xa;MONITORING: Discord → Parser &amp; Validation Summary" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="490" y="1900" width="420" height="380" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
